        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_02",
      "hash64": "F2613DE6987F4259",
      "text": "S-sorry, did I startle ya?[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_03",
      "hash64": "F2613CE6987F40A6",
      "text": "I-I did mention that I’d hang back an’ follow you\\nhere...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_04",
      "hash64": "F2613FE6987F45BF",
      "text": "We’re s’posed to read the signboard, right?[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_05",
      "hash64": "F2613EE6987F440C",
      "text": "Oh, I already know the whole story, so...g-go\\nahead. You should check it out.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_system_01",
      "hash64": "593E4E7F1481F725",
      "text": "Long, long ago, there was a fearsome ogre in the\\nland of Kitakami.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_system_02",
      "hash64": "593E4B7F1481F20C",
      "text": "The ogre made its home in the mountain behind\\nthe village, frightening all who ventured there.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_system_03",
      "hash64": "593E4C7F1481F3BF",
      "text": "One day, the ogre came down from the mountain\\nin a terrible rage, causing great fear in the village.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_system_04",
      "hash64": "593E497F1481EEA6",
      "text": "By some stroke of luck, Okidogi, Munkidori, and\\nFezandipiti all happened to be there as well.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_system_05",
      "hash64": "593E4A7F1481F059",
      "text": "The three Pokémon laid down their lives to fend\\noff the ogre and send it back to the mountain.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_system_06",
      "hash64": "593E477F1481EB40",
      "text": "In admiration, the people of the village bestowed\\nupon this brave trio the title “the Loyal Three.”",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_system_07",
      "hash64": "593E487F1481ECF3",
      "text": "Their remains were given a proper burial, and\\nstatues of the three were erected above the site.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_27",
      "hash64": "F25AD0E6987A1D74",
      "text": "The Loyal Three Monument is right over there...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_06",
      "hash64": "F26141E6987F4925",
      "text": "But don’t you think the ogre in that folktale\\nsounds kinda...cool?[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_select_01",
      "hash64": "E2B4A8FA0E740A62",
      "text": "Yeah, it sure does!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_select_02",
      "hash64": "E2B4A7FA0E7408AF",
      "text": "You think...?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_07",
      "hash64": "F26140E6987F4772",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Right?! I knew you’d get it,\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]!\\c\\nIt was up against three whole opponents at once,\\nbattling it out all by itself—wowzers, that’s so cool![VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 145,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_08",
      "hash64": "F26143E6987F4C8B",
      "text": "C’mon, it was all alone!\\c\\nThe battle was three against one, but the ogre\\nstill managed to hold its own. That’s way cool![VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_09",
      "hash64": "F26142E6987F4AD8",
      "text": "Oh... But I guess most people would just think\\nan ogre like that is scary, huh? I don’t think\\r\\nthere’s any reason to be afraid...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_10",
      "hash64": "F25DD5E6987C5BCA",
      "text": "When I was little, I went up into the mountain so\\nmany times at night—all on my own—an’ I never\\r\\nonce met that ogre.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 118,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_11",
      "hash64": "F25DD6E6987C5D7D",
      "text": "Only scary thing that happened was the\\ngrown-ups givin’ me a real earful about it...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_12",
      "hash64": "F25DD3E6987C5864",
      "text": "Umm... So yeah, we’re s’posed to take a photo\\nin front of the signboard, right?[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_13",
      "hash64": "F25DD4E6987C5A17",
      "text": "I don’t have a smartphone... Could you...?[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_14",
      "hash64": "F25DD1E6987C54FE",
      "text": "That turned out great. You’re even good at\\ntaking photos...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_select_03",
      "hash64": "E2B4A6FA0E7406FC",
      "text": "Thanks!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_select_04",
      "hash64": "E2B4A5FA0E740549",
      "text": "You wanna try?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_15",
      "hash64": "F25DD2E6987C56B1",
      "text": "S-sorry... Not trying to butter you up or anythin’...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_16",
      "hash64": "F25DCFE6987C5198",
      "text": "Oh! No! I didn’t mean—\\c\\nM-maybe...next time...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
